 "summary": "There is no single procedure: the FCOM PBN chapter says what to do for RNAV 1(2) and RNP 1 airspace, and both lists are the same. A message on one side: continue on the FMGC that provides the correct position. A message on both sides or a position disagreement: find the correct FMGC on the MCDU PROG page and continue on it. NAV ACCUR DOWNGRAD on both sides: tell ATC the capability is lost.",
